{"articleNo":"90267","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=90267&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"'13 2nd semester Regular Checkup for students living in a dormitory","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.09.03","hit":"3118","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">'13 2nd semester Regular Checkup</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">for students living in a dormitory </span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">Every students staying in a dormitory for the 2nd semester of 2013 has to have health examination(TB_tuberculosis, radiation check) as below. Since it is one year based checkup, students who already took health checkup last semester do not have to take.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>1. Period</strong> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>9. 9(Mon) ~ 9. 11(Wed) 14:00-20:00</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2. Place</strong> :<strong> dormitory administrative bldg 1st floor, Ping-Pong room</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>3. Cost</strong> : <strong>free</strong> (dormitory will pay 5,000KRW for every students staying in dormitory)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>This regular checkup is not an optional, everyone has to take health checkup during designated period. If not, students have to go to see a doctor and take checkup with paying their own money, and have to submit medical report. </strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2013. 9</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">KIT Dormitory</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
